 "headline": "Kenrich Williams Hijacking Gopher Gold's Night",
 "notes": [
  "Thug Life's Jaden McDaniels has 32 points on 11-15 shooting, and Camara's 0-2 is the only dent in an otherwise ugly night for everyone else.",
  "theInfamous just stole assists from Gopher Gold, even though LeBron James has 12 of them. Day'Ron Sharpe's 14 boards and 3 steals did the dirty work.",
  "Nova Knicks yanked OREB away from LeParth James, who is watching a 7-3 lead melt to 6-5. Anfernee Simons and Klay Thompson are doing nothing to stop it.",
  "Brandon Miller has 35 points for Suggs to be you, and Danny Wolf answered with 5 points on 2-8 shooting. Zero Fox Given is still tied 5-5 with a Giannis 32-14.",
  "Da Don Da Beard & Da Klaw trail BrookynDynasty 3-8 with a bench full of nobodies producing nothing. Not one benched player in the league did anything useful tonight."
 ],
